  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Face to face course &quot;Foundation of BEPS and related topics&quot; (17-20 March 2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pre-B.A.T. 4-day face-to-face workshop, held in Addis Ababa from 17&#x2013;20 March, provided a more in-depth understanding of the BEPS issues. The workshop also served as an introduction and explanation to the key features of the B.A.T. questionnaire in preparation for the assessment.  The workshop was attended by the Ethiopia B.A.T. stakeholders represented by staff from the Ministry of Finance (MoF) and the Ministry of Revenue (MoR).</narrative>
  </description>
